<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #1c1917; line-height: 1.6; background: #f5f5f4; margin: 0; padding: 20px; }
    .card { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #e7e5e4; padding: 32px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
    .header { border-bottom: 2px solid #b91c1c; padding-bottom: 16px; margin-bottom: 24px; text-align: center; }
    .title { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #0c0a09; margin: 0 0 4px 0; }
    .footer { margin-top: 32px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid #f5f5f4; font-size: 12px; color: #a8a29e; text-align: center; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="header">
      <h1 class="title">Muchea Stockfeed &amp; Hardware</h1>
      <p style="color: #78716c; font-size: 13px; margin: 0;">Account Registration Update</p>
    </div>

    <p>G'day <%= @customer.first_name %>,</p>

    <p>
      Thank you for your interest in Muchea Stockfeed &amp; Hardware.
      Following review of your profile details, we were unable to activate your online account at this time.
    </p>

    <% if @customer.rejection_reason.present? %>
      <div style="background: #fef2f2; border-left: 4px solid #b91c1c; padding: 12px 16px; margin: 16px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #991b1b;">
        <strong>Reason:</strong> <%= @customer.rejection_reason %>
      </div>
    <% end %>

    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #44403c;">
      If you believe this was an error, or if you need to update your property or business details, please contact our shed directly on <strong>(08) 9571 8840</strong> or reply to this email.
    </p>

    <div class="footer">
      Muchea Trading Pty Ltd • 17b Edwards Pl, Muchea WA 6501<br>
      ABN 56 700 841 550 • ACN 700 841 550
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
